            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "RENDERGRAPH",
          "id": "1770178492606",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770178492608_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a data visualization assistant.\n\n Data = {{$context.$nodes.PROCESSOTBIDATA.$output.result}}\nCalculations:\nOTBIData = Set otbiData from Data\nAvgCurrentResolutionTime =  Set otbiDataAvg from Data \nAvgPreviousResolutionTime =  Set prevOtbiDataAvg from Data \n\nCalculate ChangeIndicator;\n   -  ChangeIndicator = AvgCurrentResolutionTime - AvgPreviousResolutionTime\n\nPanel Summary :\n  - Include  most recent 10 days and preceding 10 day period , AvgCurrentResolutionTime, AvgPreviousResolutionTime, ChangeIndicator values  to generate the panel summary. \n    Example summary to be considered  If AvgCurrentResolutionTime < AvgPreviousResolutionTime:\n             The average resolution time for the most recent 10-day period is 10.26 hours, compared to 28.33 hours in the preceding 10-day period, indicating a significant worsening. The trend reflects a clear reduction in  average resolution time.\n        Example summary to be considered if  If AvgCurrentResolutionTime > AvgPreviousResolutionTime:\n           The average resolution time for the most recent 10-day period is 28.33 hours, compared to 10.26 hours in the preceding 10-day period, indicating a significant improvement. The trend reflects a clear rise in average resolution time.\n\nIMPORTANT: \n    -  Strictly show Key Insights in the format provided.\n    -  AvgCurrentResolutionTime  and AvgPreviousResolutionTime values are provided in Hours units, don't do any conversion. Retain The value in hours\n    - The heading should be \"Average Resolution Time\"\n    - Avoid plotting Line chart for PreviousResolutionTime. Strictly plot line chart for AvgCurrentResolutionTime\n    - Strictly follow what is mentioned under Key Insights. Don't suggest anything new or change.\n    - Replace Avg text with Average wherever require\n    - If ChangeIndicator is positive then set str = Average resolution time  increased by ▲ {ChangeIndicator}, indicating worsened resolution effectiveness , set symbol = ▲ \n    - If ChangeIndicator is negative,  then set str = Average resolution time decreased by ▼ {ChangeIndicator}, indicating improved resolution effectiveness , set symbol = ▼ \n   - If ChangeIndicator is minimal then set str = Average resolution time  is stable\n\nChart Widget:\n - Use the chartWidget to create a Line Chart based on  OTBIData\n - If OTBIData is empty then show a blank chart\n - Plot the Date on the X-axis\n- The heading should be blank\n- Set Chart dataset label = Avg. Resolution Time (Hrs)\n- Display the the legend value completely.\n- Insights:\n    - Average resolution time over the last 10 days is {AvgCurrentResolutionTime} hours\n    - Average resolution time in the prior 10-day period was {AvgPreviousResolutionTime} hours\n    - {str}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "description": "Add node for Query case branch",
            "name": "Add (Query Case)"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "id": "add_Query_1770178384252",
          "inputs": [],
          "type": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [
                "ORA_LAYOUT_CHART"
              ],
              "enableActions": false,
              "enableCommunications": false
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "name": "createGraph"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "CREATEGRAPH",
          "id": "1774411934322",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1774411934326_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a data visualization assistant.\n\nCalculations:\n - CurrentReopenData= {{$context.$nodes.FETCHREOPENRATEDATA.$output}}\n - PreviousReopenData = {{$context.$nodes.FETCHPREVIOUSREOPENRATEDATA.$output}} \n - Calculate (sum of % Resolved SRs Reopened)/10 using the CurrentReopenData and store in AvgCurrentReopenRate\n - Calculate (sum of % Resolved SRs Reopened )/10 using the PreviousReopenData and store in AvgPreviousReopenRate\n - Calculate the difference of AvgCurrentReopenRate and AvgPreviousReopenRate and store in ChangeIndicator.\n\nPanel Summary :\n - Include  most recent 10 days and preceding 10 day period , AvgCurrentReopenRate, AvgPreviousReopenRate, ChangeIndicator values  to generate the panel summary.\n       Example summary to be considered if there is improvement in  average reopen rate:\n             The average reopen rate for the most recent 10-day period is 10.26%, compared to 28.33% in the preceding 10-day period, indicating a significant improvement. The trend reflects a clear reduction in   average reopen rate.\n       Example summary to be considered if there is decline in  average reopen rate:\n           The average reopen rate for the most recent 10-day period is 28.33%, compared to 10.26% in the preceding 10-day period, indicating a noticeable worsening. The trend reflects a clear rise in average reopen rate.\n\n\nIMPORTANT: \n    - The heading should be \"Reopen Rate\".\n    - ChangeIndicator is negative then , set str = Reopen rate decreased by ▼ {ChangeIndicator}%, indicating improved resolution effectiveness, set symbol =  ▼ \n    - ChangeIndicator is positive then, set str = Reopen rate increased by ▲ {ChangeIndicator}%, indicating worsened resolution effectiveness, set symbol = ▲    \n    - ChangeIndicator is minimal , set str = \"Reopen rate is stable\"\n    - Skip showing the minus sign\n    - Replace '% Resolved SRs Reopened' with 'Reopen Rate %'\n\n    \nChart Widget:\n - Use the chartWidget to create a Line Chart based on  CurrentReopenData\n - If CurrentReopenData is empty then show a blank chart\n - Title : Set blank\n- Set Chart dataset label = Reopen Rate %\n - Insights:\n     - Average reopen rate over the last 10 days is {AvgCurrentReopenRate}%\n    - Average reopen rate in the prior 10-day period was {AvgPreviousReopenRate}%\n    -  {str}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Run in Parallel"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "0": "1774411812529",
            "1": "1774787817334",
            "2": "add_1774800463769_2"
          },
          "code": "PARALLEL_1774800463770",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1774411934322",
          "id": "1774800463769",
          "inputs": [],
          "type": "PARALLEL"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "businessObjectCode": "ORA_CX_SERVICECEN_GETOTBIDATA",
            "functionName": "GetOTBIData",
            "name": "fetchReopenRateData"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1774411934322"
          },
          "code": "FETCHREOPENRATEDATA",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1774800470665",
          "id": "1774411812529",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1774411863711_1",
              "name": "pPayload",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{\n  \"executionOptions\": {\n    \"async\": \"false\",\n    \"presentationInfo\": \"false\",\n    \"refresh\": \"false\",\n    \"maxRowsPerPage\": 40\n  },\n  \"outputFormat\": \"SAWRowsetSchemaAndData\",\n  \"sessionId\": \"1\",\n  \"sqlQuery\": \"SELECT \\\"Service - CRM Service Request Lifecycle\\\".\\\"Service Request Secondary Dates\\\".\\\"Change Start Date\\\" as ChangeStartDate,  \\\"Service - CRM Service Request Lifecycle\\\".\\\"Service Request Lifecycle Facts\\\".\\\"% Resolved SRs Reopened\\\"  as ReopenRate FROM \\\"Service - CRM Service Request Lifecycle\\\" WHERE (\\\"Service Request Secondary Dates\\\".\\\"Change Start Date\\\" >= (TIMESTAMPADD(SQL_TSI_DAY, -10, CURRENT_DATE))  AND \\\"Service Request Secondary Dates\\\".\\\"Change Start Date\\\" < CURRENT_DATE AND  (\\\"Service Resource Lifecycle Hierarchy\\\".\\\"User Organization Hierarchy Based Login\\\" =  VALUEOF(NQ_SESSION.\\\"USER_PARTY_ID\\\")) AND (DESCRIPTOR_IDOF(\\\"Service Request Lifecycle\\\".\\\"Stripe\\\") = 'ORA_SVC_CRM')  AND (\\\"Service Request Lifecycle\\\".\\\"Latest Change Flag\\\" = 'Y'))\"\n}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{}",
          "type": "BO_FUNCTION"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "description": "Add node for branch 2",
            "name": "Add 2"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1774411934322"
          },
          "id": "add_1774800463769_2",
          "inputs": [],
          "type": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "businessObjectCode": "ORA_CX_SERVICECEN_GETOTBIDATA",
            "functionName": "GetOTBIData",
            "name": "fetchPreviousReopenRateData"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1774411934322"
          },
          "code": "FETCHPREVIOUSREOPENRATEDATA",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1774800499416",
          "id": "1774787817334",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1774787841303_1",
              "name": "pPayload",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{\n  \"executionOptions\": {\n    \"async\": \"false\",\n    \"presentationInfo\": \"false\",\n    \"refresh\": \"false\",\n    \"maxRowsPerPage\": 40\n  },\n  \"outputFormat\": \"SAWRowsetSchemaAndData\",\n  \"sessionId\": \"1\",\n  \"sqlQuery\": \"SELECT \\\"Service - CRM Service Request Lifecycle\\\".\\\"Service Request Secondary Dates\\\".\\\"Change Start Date\\\" as ChangeStartDate,  \\\"Service - CRM Service Request Lifecycle\\\".\\\"Service Request Lifecycle Facts\\\".\\\"% Resolved SRs Reopened\\\"  as ReopenRate FROM \\\"Service - CRM Service Request Lifecycle\\\" WHERE (\\\"Service Request Secondary Dates\\\".\\\"Change Start Date\\\" >= (TIMESTAMPADD(SQL_TSI_DAY, -20, CURRENT_DATE)) and \\\"Service Request Secondary Dates\\\".\\\"Change Start Date\\\" < (TIMESTAMPADD(SQL_TSI_DAY, -10, CURRENT_DATE))   AND  (\\\"Service Resource Lifecycle Hierarchy\\\".\\\"User Organization Hierarchy Based Login\\\" =  VALUEOF(NQ_SESSION.\\\"USER_PARTY_ID\\\")) AND (DESCRIPTOR_IDOF(\\\"Service Request Lifecycle\\\".\\\"Stripe\\\") = 'ORA_SVC_CRM')   AND (\\\"Service Request Lifecycle\\\".\\\"Latest Change Flag\\\" = 'Y') ) \"\n}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{}",
          "type": "BO_FUNCTION"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "description": "Add node for default case branch",
            "name": "Add (default Case)"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "id": "add_default_1770178384252",
          "inputs": [],
          "type": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "processOTBIData",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "var otbidata  = [];\nvar avgCurrent  = 0;\nvar avgPrevious  = 0;\nif($context.$nodes.GETOTBIDATA.$output.hasOwnProperty('Rows'))\n{\n   const data = $context.$nodes.GETOTBIDATA.$output.Rows;\n   data.forEach(item => {\n          item.Column2 = item.Column1 \n          item.Column1 = item.Column1 / 60;  // Convert minutes to hours\n          otbidata.push(item); \n    });\n    const sum = data.reduce((acc, item) => acc + item.Column1, 0);\n    avgCurrent = sum / 10;\n   avgCurrent = avgCurrent.toFixed(2);\n}\n\n\nif($context.$nodes.GETAVGPREVIOUSDATA.$output .hasOwnProperty('Rows'))\n{\n   const data = $context.$nodes.GETAVGPREVIOUSDATA.$output.Rows;\n   // Calculate sum\n   const sum = data.reduce((acc, item) => acc + item.Column1/60, 0);\n\n  // Calculate average\n   avgPrevious = sum / 10;\n   avgPrevious = avgPrevious.toFixed(2);\n}\n\nvar jsonObj = {\"otbiData\":otbidata, \"otbiDataAvg\":avgCurrent, \"prevOtbiDataAvg\":avgPrevious}\nreturn jsonObj;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1770178384252"
          },
          "code": "PROCESSOTBIDATA",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1770178514234",
          "id": "1775046609580",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
